# YouTube Community Management

Lux provides transport-neutral helpers for YouTube comment analysis, response
suggestions, moderation, community post scheduling, subscriber interaction
patterns, promotion planning, and engagement campaigns.

## Comment Analysis

```elixir
alias Lux.Integrations.YouTube.CommunityManager

CommunityManager.analyze_comment(%{
  id: "comment-1",
  author_channel_id: "author-1",
  text: "Great and helpful video!"
})
```

## Response Suggestions

```elixir
CommunityManager.response_suggestion(
  %{id: "comment-1", text: "How do I deploy this?"},
  %{answer: "start with the release checklist"}
)
```

## Moderation Queue

```elixir
CommunityManager.moderation_queue([
  %{id: "clean", text: "Thanks"},
  %{id: "review", text: "This is broken"}
])
```

## Community Posts

```elixir
CommunityManager.schedule_post(%{
  text: "Vote on the next tutorial",
  scheduled_at: "2026-05-14T12:00:00Z",
  poll_options: ["OAuth", "Analytics"],
  campaign_id: "campaign-1"
})
```

## Interaction Patterns

```elixir
CommunityManager.interaction_patterns([
  %{author_channel_id: "a", type: :comment},
  %{author_channel_id: "a", type: :reply},
  %{author_channel_id: "b", type: :comment}
])
```

## Promotion Plan

```elixir
CommunityManager.promotion_plan(%{
  title: "New video",
  url: "https://youtu.be/1"
})
```

## Campaign

```elixir
CommunityManager.campaign(%{
  campaign_id: "campaign-1",
  title: "New video",
  url: "https://youtu.be/1",
  comments: [
    %{id: "comment-1", author_channel_id: "a", text: "Great video!"}
  ],
  community_posts: [
    %{text: "What next?", scheduled_at: "2026-05-14T12:00:00Z"}
  ]
})
```

Feed campaign output into scheduled jobs, moderation dashboards, or notification
workflows.
